0" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="740.0" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="740.0" y="164" text-anchor="middle">8</text><title>1818: Peshwa Baji Rao II surrenders to the British and the Peshwa's office is abolished</title></g><text class="rf-axis" x="20" y="200">1674 CE</text><text class="rf-axis" x="740" y="200" text-anchor="end">1818 CE</text></svg><figcaption>Relative power on the Institute's 0–10 scale (each profile scaled to its own peak). Numbers mark the key events below.</figcaption></figure><ol class="rf-events"><li><span class="rf-year">1646</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shivaji">Shivaji</a> captures the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/torna-fort">fort of Torna</a>, beginning his rise</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1659</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shivaji">Shivaji</a> kills the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bijapur">Bijapur</a> general <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/afzal-khan-general">Afzal Khan</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pratapgad">Pratapgad</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1674</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shivaji">Shivaji</a> is crowned <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chhatrapati">Chhatrapati</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/raigad">Raigad</a>, formally asserting <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sovereignty">sovereignty</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1689</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shivaji">Shivaji</a>'s son Sambhaji is executed during the long war with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aurangzeb">Aurangzeb</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1728</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peshwa">Peshwa</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/baji-rao-i">Baji Rao I</a> defeats the Nizam at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-palkhed">Palkhed</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1758</span><span class="rf-text">Maratha armies reach <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/attock">Attock</a> on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/indus">Indus</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1761</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/durrani-empire">Durrani</a> army of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ahmad-shah-abdali">Ahmad Shah Abdali</a> crushes the Marathas at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/third-battle-of-panipat">Third Battle of Panipat</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1818</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/baji-rao-ii">Peshwa Baji Rao II</a> surrenders to the British and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peshwa">Peshwa</a>'s office is abolished</span></li></ol>
